  "title": "Access recertification review",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Access recertification review</h2><p>Evaluate four findings from a user-access review.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs1-f1\">Control needed for the terminated user</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs1-f1\"><option value=\"Timely deprovisioning\">Timely deprovisioning</option><option value=\"Permanent retention of login rights\">Permanent retention of login rights</option><option value=\"A new shared password\">A new shared password</option><option value=\"No action\">No action</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs1-f2\">Concern with the transferred employee</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs1-f2\"><option value=\"Incompatible retained privileges\">Incompatible retained privileges</option><option value=\"Guaranteed segregation of duties\">Guaranteed segregation of duties</option><option value=\"Only a job-title formatting issue\">Only a job-title formatting issue</option><option value=\"No authorization risk\">No authorization risk</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs1-f3\">Concern with the shared administrator account</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs1-f3\"><option value=\"Weak individual accountability\">Weak individual accountability</option><option value=\"Automatic least privilege\">Automatic least privilege</option><option value=\"Perfect attribution\">Perfect attribution</option><option value=\"No need for logs\">No need for logs</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs1-f4\">Concern with omitted service accounts</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs1-f4\"><option value=\"Incomplete review population\">Incomplete review population</option><option value=\"All nonhuman accounts are risk-free\">All nonhuman accounts are risk-free</option><option value=\"A guaranteed effective review\">A guaranteed effective review</option><option value=\"Only backup timing\">Only backup timing</option></select></div></section>",
